00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:11.910
This is just a plain, ordinary yellow-skinned onion,

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:14.970
but it made of French soup, famous.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:16.620
Soupe à l'oignon.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:20.200
And here it is, hot out of the oven,

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:25.830
bubbling, rich and brown, and filled with cheese,

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:29.150
and laced with good French brandy.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.680
I'm just going to serve you some so you'll see how it looks, how it smells so good.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:42.920
We're doing soup à l'oignon gratiné next time on The French Chef.

