I'm just putting a lot of cheese on the top of it, and then a little bit of oil goes on,

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:15.130
and then it's going to go into the oven, and it's going to bake so all the cheese melts,

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:19.740
and it's going to come out wonderfully browned and beautiful smelling.

